[3b] Regression diagnostics (linearity, homoscedasticity, normality)...
  --- Regression diagnostics (autosomal training genes, Human fibroblast (ribonn)) ---
  Normality of TE (actual, log2 scale, n=9,505): skew = 0.037, excess kurtosis = 0.526, D'Agostino K^2 p = 1.56e-16, Jarque-Bera p = 5.3e-25
  Normality of residuals: skew = -0.109, excess kurtosis = 0.874, D'Agostino K^2 p = 4.58e-38, Jarque-Bera p = 1.61e-70
  Homoscedasticity (Breusch-Pagan): LM stat = 320.431, p = 7.28e-37
  Linearity (Ramsey RESET, power=3 on fitted values): F = 12.038, p = 6.01e-06
  (in each test, p < 0.05 => reject the null of normality / homoscedasticity / linearity)
  Saved: /lab/solexa_page/xueqi/analysis_codon/figures/ribonn/fibroblast/co_mega_regression_diagnostics_te_histogram_ribonn_fibroblast.png
